release, is not affiliated with the upstream maintainer, and is not endorsed by
the upstream project.

Modifications made by this fork include a native local-music tag workshop,
multi-source metadata matching, batch tag application, DSF/DFF/M4A tag support,
and the distribution and documentation changes listed in CHANGES.md.

